{"id":"3e270c20bc5033b3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-interactive-transcript.md","title":"Interactive Transcript","display":"df-interactive-transcript — Interactive Transcript","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-interactive-transcript","aliases":["28-df-interactive-transcript","Interactive Transcript"],"display":"df-interactive-transcript — Interactive Transcript","depends_on":["[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 8.2 and 8.6; explicit padded strategy interface","source_printed_pages":"144–147","source_pdf_pages":"170–173","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-interactive-transcript"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-interactive-transcript</span><span>Interactive Transcript</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interactive-transcript — Interactive Transcript"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 8.2 and 8.6; explicit padded strategy interface"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"144–147"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"170–173"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\le b}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^b\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\le b}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^b\\Sigma^j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空比特串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span> 为空有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 为序列拼接，并置书写的比特串表示串拼接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{blk},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\">\\(\\operatorname{blk},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_3\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；单比特串与对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 认同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span>；验证者候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\">\\(V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,D\">\\(Q,D\\)</span> 为一元字符串函数，带历史参数的调用采用下式编码接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为不受可计算性或复杂度限制的函数策略；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_P\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(r_P\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是证明者的固定随机带，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\">\\(r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\)</span> 是验证者私有随机带。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span> 的历史参数保留为有限字符串序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_V\">\\(\\ell_V\\)</span>、消息递归、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}\\)</span> 仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathsf{IV}\">\\(V\\in\\mathsf{IV}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\">\\(r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\)</span> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}\">\\(\\operatorname{Trans}\\)</span> 的值为结构化有限记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}\\)</span> 为其字符串表示，记录最后一项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 在序列编码中写为单比特串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{blk}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}(\\langle w\\rangle^\\frown h)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\operatorname{blk}(h),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)\\coloneqq1^{|h|}0\\operatorname{blk}(h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{blk}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}(\\langle w\\rangle^\\frown h)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\operatorname{blk}(h),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)\\coloneqq1^{|h|}0\\operatorname{blk}(h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}:(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_t\\rangle)|=2\\sum_{i=1}^t|w_i|+2t+1\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}:(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_t\\rangle)|=2\\sum_{i=1}^t|w_i|+2t+1\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F(x,r,h)\\coloneqq F(\\operatorname{tup}_3(x,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)))\\quad(F\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\ x,r\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F(x,r,h)\\coloneqq F(\\operatorname{tup}_3(x,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)))\\quad(F\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\ x,r\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IV}\\coloneqq\\{(k,b,p,Q,D):\\;&amp;k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,D\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)})^{\\le2k(|x|)}\\ [|Q(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\land D(x,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IV}\\coloneqq\\{(k,b,p,Q,D):\\;&amp;k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,D\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)})^{\\le2k(|x|)}\\ [|Q(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\land D(x,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\coloneqq\\{P:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*:\\forall x,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ |P(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\coloneqq\\{P:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*:\\forall x,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{&lt;\\omega}\\ |P(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_V(x)\\coloneqq2k(|x|),\\qquad m_{&lt;i}\\coloneqq\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{i-1}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_V(x)\\coloneqq2k(|x|),\\qquad m_{&lt;i}\\coloneqq\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{i-1}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}P(x,r_P,m_{&lt;i})&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\Q(x,r_V,m_{&lt;i})&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad1\\le i\\le\\ell_V(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}P(x,r_P,m_{&lt;i})&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\Q(x,r_V,m_{&lt;i})&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad1\\le i\\le\\ell_V(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)},D(x,r_V,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)},D(x,r_V,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trans}(P,V,x,r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trans}(P,V,x,r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x,m_i\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x,m_i\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-p(|x|)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}D(x,r,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\big|_{r_P=\\epsilon,\\ r_V=r}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-p(|x|)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}D(x,r,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\big|_{r_P=\\epsilon,\\ r_V=r}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>序列码先写项数，再逐项写长度和内容；空列表编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。其长度由正式等式给定，编码、合法性检查和逐项解码只需线性扫描。可变项数不使用右结合配对，因而不会造成递归配对的指数码长。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>下标递归按消息编号良基展开，最后一位是接受比特，消息数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_V(x)\">\\(\\ell_V(x)\\)</span>。选择证明者先发、总消息数为偶数，可用空消息填充模拟验证者先发与可提前终止协议。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>IP 只需确定型证明者（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_P=\\epsilon\">\\(r_P=\\epsilon\\)</span>）；任意随机证明者是确定型策略的混合。Trans 的两条随机带接口也可供密码学 view 使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definitions 8.2 and 8.6; explicit padded strategy interface，印刷页 144–147；PDF 页 170–173。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$、$\\operatorname{tup}_3$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；单比特串与对应的 $0,1$ 认同。$k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]$；验证者候选 $V=(k,b,p,Q,D)$ 中 $Q,D$ 为一元字符串函数，带历史参数的调用采用下式编码接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^{\\le b}=\\bigcup_{j=0}^b\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{blk},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_3","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"V=(k,b,p,Q,D)","display":false},{"tex":"Q,D","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"r_P\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\in\\mathsf{IV}","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"r_V\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{blk}(())\\coloneqq\\epsilon,\\qquad\\operatorname{blk}(\\langle w\\rangle^\\frown h)\\coloneqq1^{|w|}0w\\operatorname{blk}(h),\\qquad\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)\\coloneqq1^{|h|}0\\operatorname{blk}(h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}:(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*,\\qquad|\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle w_1,\\ldots,w_t\\rangle)|=2\\sum_{i=1}^t|w_i|+2t+1\\quad(t\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}),\\qquad\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(z)\\coloneqq\\iota h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\;\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)=z\\quad(z\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}})).","display":true},{"tex":"F(x,r,h)\\coloneqq F(\\operatorname{tup}_3(x,r,\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(h)))\\quad(F\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\ x,r\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{IV}\\coloneqq\\{(k,b,p,Q,D):\\;&k,b,p\\in\\mathbb N[n],\\ Q,D\\in\\mathbf{FP},\\\\\n&\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^{\\le b(|x|)})^{\\le2k(|x|)}\\ [|Q(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\land D(x,r,h)\\in\\{0,1\\}]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Strat}_b\\coloneqq\\{P:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\times(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\to\\Sigma^*:\\forall x,r\\in\\Sigma^*\\ \\forall h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}\\ |P(x,r,h)|\\le b(|x|)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell_V(x)\\coloneqq2k(|x|),\\qquad m_{<i}\\coloneqq\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{i-1}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"m_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}P(x,r_P,m_{<i})&i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\Q(x,r_V,m_{<i})&i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad1\\le i\\le\\ell_V(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)},D(x,r_V,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Trans}(P,V,x,r_P,r_V)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Trans}_{P,V}(x;r_P,r_V).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{trans}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,a\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}(\\langle x,m_1,\\ldots,m_\\ell,\\langle a\\rangle\\rangle)\\quad(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\ x,m_i\\in\\Sigma^*,\\ a\\in\\{0,1\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}(x)\\coloneqq2^{-p(|x|)}\\sum_{r\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}}D(x,r,\\langle m_1,\\ldots,m_{\\ell_V(x)}\\rangle)\\big|_{r_P=\\epsilon,\\ r_V=r}.","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_V(x)","display":false},{"tex":"r_P=\\epsilon","display":false}],"bytes":4951,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ae23e6f000106e1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}$、$P\\in\\mathsf{Strat}_b$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。"},{"id":"84a4c3a277344dd9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。$\\epsilon$ 为空串，$()$ 为空历史，$\\frown$ 表示追加；历史 $t\\in(\\mathbb B^*\\times\\mathbb B^*)^{<\\omega}$ 的元素为一对询问/应答字符串。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{hist}}$ 为下式的二层有限序列编码；$\\operatorname{tag}$ 编码一个标志比特与一个字符串；$\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码自然数。$\\operatorname{Enc}_k$ 含显式安全参数 $1^n$。"},{"id":"0b39f28135327595","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$、$\\operatorname{Acc}_{P,V}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]；$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)$。"},{"id":"f3458f62defc55ad","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与 $\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]，$\\operatorname{tup}_3$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；各证明者的策略参数仅为公共输入、自身随机带与自身问答历史。"},{"id":"8e6a863785f69243","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$V=(k,b,p,Q,D)\\in\\mathsf{IV}$，$\\mathsf{IV},\\mathsf{Strat}_b,\\operatorname{Trans},\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{seq}}$ 见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。"},{"id":"74e0b51f1b8e81e1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{IV}$、验证者元组 $W=(k_W,b_W,p_W,Q_W,D_W)$ 来自 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]；每个作弊验证者按固定多项式轮数、随机带及消息界补空消息并加计时器表示。$\\mathcal V_{P,R}$ 是下式定义的、消息界足够容纳 $P$ 有效证书输出的验证者表示；$h\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{<\\omega}$ 为任意有限消息历史，$r\\in\\Sigma^*$ 为任意证明者随机带。任何均匀多项式时间作弊策略都可把界放大到共同多项式并在超时或格式错误时停止，纳入此表示。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"交互协议：[[28-df-interactive-transcript]]、[[28-df-completeness-soundness]]、[[28-df-ip]]、[[28-df-am]]、[[28-df-ma]]、[[28-df-mip]]。"},{"id":"433dd7d4f3bb14c3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{IP}$ 见 [[28-df-ip]]；$\\mathsf{IV}$、$\\mathsf{Strat}_b$ 与接受概率见 [[28-df-interactive-transcript]]。"}],"outgoing":["adb92775ec020a0b"]}